ot a function, but a variable...i set it so that it showed that the ghost was killed, instead ofchecking for the corpseit resets every reset...as for the \\n, it was a change in /room/room.cand other objects that you do not need them in the middle of descriptions, only at the end, since the code already formats it to80 characters per line...that is the change. my recodes help toclean up the code and make it more efficient and readable...ichanged nothing of what you wanted there...as for recoding it all, take your time and get it all right...otherwise, have a good daykryll**alex**To: thumperSubj: poemsCc: alexDate: Mar 14ok just a quicky hope u like it        A perfect world In a perfect world of perfect dreamsno one need ever cryno heart shall breaknor bad emotions makeand all shall be content In a simple world of simple wordsThere never is confusionwhere every one says what they meanand mean what they sayand all shall tell and know the truth In a wearing world of wearing thoughtsloanleness is never there, it is forever absentalways there is some one to turn tofor encouragement, for audience, for loveand all shall have comfort But in this world in which we liveno perfect dreams aboundnor simple words make doand not all care for your sorrowsbut one thing is trueabout me and youis that we must all have a dream in mindour soul have the words that need to be spokenand in our hearts, we careWe care allotDS 1995enjoy Daniel/Alex/K**kryll**To: alexSubj: no probDate: Mar 14just let me know when you have finished your changes andi'll go through it againkryll**kryll**To: alexSubj: no worriesDate: Mar 17just let me know whenever...kryll**guest**To: alexSubj: MUD characterCc: Airborne Redexy Redsxy RedsexyDate: Apr 18Hi ALexMy name is Dave New, you met me once at one of Sarah E's partiesI want to play on HM again and Airbrone wants confirmationthat my old character was Qume.